&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FULL-STACK SOFTWARE ENGINEER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is building the future of sports performance technology, with a mission to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Unleash the Potential&lt;/strong&gt; of every athlete and team on earth. We don&#39;t just work in the sporting industry; we are actively changing it.&amp;nbsp; Since 2006, our solutions have been leading the way in sports performance software, science, and data, in a world where 1% can literally mean the difference between winning and losing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with over 5,000+ teams around the world, empowering coaches, managers and trainers in premier teams in the NFL, NBA, NHL, MLS, EPL, AFL, NRL, NCAA and more. We provide the information they need to optimize athletes’ health, game-day readiness, and performance, as well as in-game tactics.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a sports technology company that empowers professional teams to make data-driven decisions. We deliver health, performance, video, and AI insights from the locker room to competitive environments, ensuring every decision is an opportunity to gain an advantage, sharpen performance, and build lasting success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT MAKING COACHES MORE PRODUCTIVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a foundational Web Engineer to spearhead our transition into modern web and mobile application ecosystems. Currently, our core engineering strengths lie in high-performance C++/Qt desktop development. However, as our platform evolves, we are increasingly moving key administrative, collaborative, and customer-facing workflows to the web and mobile wrapped environments. This role is a unique hybrid of architecture, rapid product prototyping, and strategic engineering leadership. You will be the first &quot;pure web&quot; engineer on this team, responsible for bridging our existing backend architecture with high-fidelity, production-grade frontend applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Productize Core Utilities&lt;/strong&gt;: Transform an existing library of internal scripts, data importers, and management tools into reliable, production-ready web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migrate &amp;amp; Innovate Workflows&lt;/strong&gt;: Decentralize complex workflows (such as group administration and user management) out of traditional thick clients and rebuild them into seamless web and hybrid experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a &quot;Tiger Team&quot; Catalyst&lt;/strong&gt;: Act as a high-mobility rapid responder to build bespoke tools, custom league integrations, and special project solutions for high-profile clients where pivoting our core platform (Focus) is too heavy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish Engineering Standards&lt;/strong&gt;: Define modern web best practices, set up robust CI/CD pipelines, and collaborate with Catapult’s wider web divisions to align technology stacks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Web Ecosystem Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive professional experience with React, modern JavaScript/TypeScript, and building cross-platform apps wrapped in Electron and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application-Layer Focus with Backend Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience consuming complex internal APIs and managing frontend state, complemented by a solid understanding of database design and backend architecture for when custom services are required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural &amp;amp; DevOps Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build web environments from scratch, including configuring optimized developer workflows, automated testing, and deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic &amp;amp; Fast-Paced Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of operating in a &quot;tiger team&quot; style capacity—capable of rapidly prototyping and delivering high-impact features under tight timelines for enterprise partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOUR SUCCESS WILL LOOK LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 6 months time…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our primary internal utilities and importers are launched as stable, production-grade web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
